# Copied word for word from the live page. Builds both the FAQ below and the FAQPage schema (seo.njk).
# lead: the answer's first sentence (its own paragraph on the page); a: the rest.
faq:
  - q: What is the minimum order quantity for screen printing at Silverscreen Decoration & Fulfillment?
    lead: We do not have a minimum order quantity for our screen printing services.
    a: Whether you have a small run or a high-volume production run, our Reno, NV facility is equipped to handle orders of any size. We apply the same meticulous quality control and cutting-edge technology to every garment, ensuring brand consistency across all quantities.
  - q: What types of screen printing inks do you offer?
    lead: Silverscreen Decoration & Fulfillment offers a variety of specialty inks, including standard plastisol, water-based, and discharge inks.
    a: We can also include specific additives upon request to achieve an ultra-soft hand feel that integrates seamlessly into the fabric. For bold, distinctive apparel, we offer metallic finishes, specialty formulations, and High Color Count SIM (CMYK) for photorealistic images.
  - q: Can you match my brand's specific Pantone colors?
    lead: Yes, our experienced team mixes all of our inks in-house to achieve exact Pantone color matching.
    a: This ensures complete brand consistency and accuracy across your entire apparel line. By controlling the ink mixing process internally, we guarantee that your printed designs perfectly reflect your established corporate identity or brand standards.
  - q: How long does screen printing take, and do you offer rush turnaround?
    lead: Our standard turnaround time for screen printing orders is 5 to 7 days.
    a: For clients with tight deadlines, we always offer firm or rush production options. Our advanced automatic screen printing presses enable us to maintain rapid turnaround times and consistent quality, ensuring your customized apparel is delivered exactly when you need it.
  - q: Can I provide my own garments for screen printing, or do you supply them?
    lead: "You can choose either option; we accept client-provided garments and also offer comprehensive procurement services for garment blanks."
    a: If you prefer, we can source the apparel. We partner with top industry brands, including Bayside, Next Level Apparel, SanMar, and S&S Activewear. All options are always available to best suit your business needs and supply chain preferences.
  - q: Are there any setup fees or hidden screen charges?
    lead: No, we do not charge any hidden setup, screen, or separation fees.
    a: Silverscreen Decoration & Fulfillment operates with complete pricing transparency. We charge one flat price per decoration location on the garment. This straightforward pricing model helps established businesses and growing brands accurately calculate costs and manage their merchandise budgets without unexpected surprises.
  - q: What quality control processes do you use for screen printing orders?
    lead: Every screen printing order undergoes strict, in-house quality control sign-offs before leaving our facility.
    a: Our meticulous quality assurance process ensures that every item, from the first shirt off the press to the final piece in a high-volume run, meets your exacting standards and maintains brand integrity.
  - q: Do you offer retail-ready finishing and fulfillment services?
    lead: Yes, we provide comprehensive retail-ready finishing and fulfillment services to streamline your operations.
    a: Our in-house capabilities include custom kitting, tagging, bagging, and custom work. As your reliable partner, we manage the entire process under one roof, functioning as a seamless extension of your business, so you can deliver premium, retail-ready apparel directly to your customers.
  - q: Can I see a physical sample or pre-production mockup before my full order is printed?
    lead: Yes, we offer pre-production samples to ensure your design meets your expectations before moving into full production.
    a: We prefer working with high-quality sample art provided by the client to generate these accurate mockups. This consultation and sampling phase ensures that the selected screen-printing techniques and materials perfectly align with your vision.
  - q: Does Silverscreen Decoration & Fulfillment use eco-friendly screen printing practices?
    lead: Yes, we are committed to eco-friendly and sustainable screen printing practices.
    a: Throughout our shop, we continuously refine our operations to minimize environmental impact. By combining our Made in America industry experience with responsible manufacturing methods, we deliver premium custom apparel that aligns with the sustainability goals of modern brands.
---
